## SAPIEN / ManiSkill

- Simulation backbone (`sapien`, `mani_skill` Python packages).
- See upstream licenses for redistribution terms.

## PartNet-Mobility assets

- Competition tasks T1–T3 use annotated subsets (assets `3558`, `8848`, `100920`).
- Additional assets are distributed via the MetaFine dataset mirrors (ModelScope / Hugging Face).

## Optional policy backends (not vendored in this release)

The full MetaFine platform supports additional VLA stacks installed separately:

- OpenVLA / OpenVLA-OFT (MIT)
- StarVLA (MIT — see upstream LICENSE for attribution requirements)
- ACT, Diffusion Policy 3D

Install instructions for these backends are maintained in their respective upstream repositories.
